      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It just made no sense to be default instance when opening the world detail since devs can't sure if it's any good than pure public(which in that case you can use shield to protect yourself.). It will kill TOO MANY newcomers just by this wrongly promote.\n\nIf they ever wanted to make group public a real mature system, the very group needed to be have good rep(or enough members) to be promoted or even open group public instance, otherwise they can always use named public. But since this canny was on 2024, guess it just not something they want to touch, just like the group limit lol",
