  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-02-12T05:30:40.795Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "As of recent a lot of worlds are dying down to only being group public instances. This raises some problems because a lot of these group publics are managed by power trapping friend groups. Most of the time people are getting kicked because someone that moderates doesn't like them and usually that's the only reason. It makes it hard for friends to enjoy hanging out in populated instances since they are all groups publics that share this same energy. I suggest making a toggle to allow group public instances to be listed, and make sure to have it off by default at least as well.",
